  m_text: 'Yargina George has always wanted to perform on stage and go on tour.


    Armed
    with their newly produced #1 hit single, Yargina and her bandmates Anton, Randrew,
    and G headline the prestigious Two Weeks Festival.


    Will their success last
    or will those pesky accusations of "nepo baby" and "payola" drag them down?'
